SaveTagChanges
Exit

DuplicateTag objects\weapons\rifle\assault_rifle\shaders\ones.shader objects\weapons\rifle\light_machine_gun\shaders\ones
EditTag objects\weapons\rifle\light_machine_gun\shaders\ones.shader
SetArgument self_illum_color 0 1 0 1
SaveTagChanges
Exit

DuplicateTag objects\weapons\rifle\assault_rifle\shaders\tens.shader objects\weapons\rifle\light_machine_gun\shaders\tens
EditTag objects\weapons\rifle\light_machine_gun\shaders\tens.shader
SetArgument self_illum_color 0 1 0 1
